WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.750
The Save event changes the variable, then sets the text.

2
00:00:04.579 --> 00:00:07.554
Minutes is a variable. It starts at zero.

3
00:00:09.369 --> 00:00:14.394
Clicking Save runs one event. It adds fifteen to Minutes, then sets the text.

4
00:00:18.972 --> 00:00:24.247
Three saves make forty-five. The screen changes because the event sets the text.
